OL,3,AUK support for Falkland Islands
OL,4,A'unwavering' after Argentina restates
OL,5,Aclaims, No 10 says
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe UK's position on the Falkland
OL,8,FIslands is "unwavering", Downing Street
OL,9,Fhas said after Argentina's president
OL,10,Fsaid the islands were "historically and
OL,11,Flegally" Argentinian.
OL,13,FAndy Burnham "fully supports the wishes
OL,14,Fof the islanders to remain a British
OL,15,Foverseas territory", a Downing Street
OL,16,Fspokesperson said.
OL,18,FJavier Milei said the "winds of change"
OL,19,Ffavoured his country's claim to the
OL,20,Fislands and pledged sanctions on firms
OL,21,Fplanning to exploit oil close to the
OL,22,Fislands.
OL,23,APub: 04-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
